  annotation "note_1771581370105_1", anchor: "a timeline that has invited speculation but no confirmed explanation", text: "The ice records her departure bearing. She went down, not out. The deep-stratum thermal trace is consistent with descent toward the Nightshelf tunnel network, not surface exodus toward the frozen sea. \"Fled the colony\" is the surface reading, literally and otherwise. She fled *into* the colony — the other colony. The dual residency at ☽'slew Nisaemesius~ was not something she acquired upon return. She was already known there.", type: :correction, display: :full
